<div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 dark:bg-amber-900/20 dark:border-amber-800 p-4 rounded-md" role="alert"><div class="flex"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><svg class="dark:text-amber-400 h-5 text-amber-500 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-2.5L13.732 4c-.77-.833-1.664-.833-2.464 0L4.35 16.5c-.77.833.192 2.5 1.732 2.5z"></path></svg></div><div class="flex-1 ms-3"><div class="flex gap-2 items-center"><h3 class="dark:text-amber-200 font-medium text-amber-800 text-sm">Invalid Input</h3><span class="bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 dark:text-amber-300 font-medium inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-amber-700 text-xs">rejection</span></div><div class="dark:text-amber-200 mt-1 text-amber-800 text-sm"><p>The email address format is invalid.</p></div><div class="mt-2"><p class="dark:text-gray-400 text-gray-600 text-sm"><span class="font-medium">Enter a valid email address like name@example.com.</span></p></div></div></div></div>